## Allowed fields (the ONLY legal `read` targets — domain.name)
<% it.grammar.descriptors.forEach(function (d) { -%>
- <%= d.domain %>.<%= d.name %> : <%= d.field_type %><% if (d.key_domain) { %> (key: <%= d.key_domain %>)<% } %> — <%= d.description %>
<% }) -%>
<% if (it.grammar.descriptors.length === 0) { -%>
(none)
<% } -%>

## Allowed spell slugs (the ONLY legal `cast` spells)

<%= it.grammar.spellSlugs.join(", ") || "(none)" %>

## Allowed aura slugs (legal `read` keys for aura domains)

<%= it.grammar.auraSlugs.join(", ") || "(none)" %>

## Allowed resource names

<%= it.grammar.resourceNames.join(", ") || "(none)" %>
